{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_0_level_main_00-01_beg","groupId":"main_0","stageId":"main_00-01","title":"坍塌","storyCode":"0-1","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_00-01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"8b8994468f96153a71659461ca78f09aad654807f2f8bd92cb8719b6d80cc97c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"切爾諾伯格中一片混亂，整合運動四處燒殺掠奪，秩序已然崩潰。\n明知應該撤退，但為了救人，羅德島還是毅然出手。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"可惡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡，究竟怎麼了？"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_2_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這邊的屋子，也都給我搜乾淨！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放開他......不！你們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"反抗？太遲了！可恨的切爾諾伯格人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快跑！不要管我......孩子就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽......媽媽......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯軍警","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別管平民！先把陣線守住！這些面具混蛋，人實在是太多了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別讓軍警閒著！繼續打！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯軍警","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"增援怎麼還沒到！我們要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"上啊，上啊！！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事......？！為什麼，為什麼整合運動會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"遮遮掩掩這麼多年，還是露出本性了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"感，感染者......在襲擊烏薩斯人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"為，為什麼！感染者這樣去騷擾烏薩斯政府的話，會死無葬身之地的......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"不，他們的攻勢相當猛烈。這絕對是有預謀的行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"之前我們救出博士的位置，相當機密......就連那裡都被他們滲入了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"可能切爾諾伯格各處，都已經遭到了整合運動的襲擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......這，怎麼會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"噓！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還有逃脫的切爾諾伯格人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我在搜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一個也別漏掉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"切爾諾伯格的冷血動物......刻在我父輩身上的痛苦，這次，就讓我全都還給你們！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（咳......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼聲音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在那裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（唔！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（他，他們，發......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"（安靜！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（唔......！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......嗚......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在這兒！找到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......嗚哇哇哇！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！不，別......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"躲在巷子裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，啊啊......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"躲在那裡，就有用嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對，對不起！對不起啊！！至少，至少饒了我的兒子！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們應該，立刻突襲整合運動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿米婭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道有風險，杜賓教官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，等這些整合運動解散後再行動......會耗費大量時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"何況，誰知道現在的狀況，會持續到什麼時候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，就應該迅速擊潰敵人並轉移。我說的，沒錯吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"——————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了，我服從你的命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"各小組，聽好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"這些整合運動，還沒有意識到我們的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"記住，果斷、迅速地解決掉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，調集隊伍吧，現在是你證明自己的時候了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"現在的局勢，可不允許我們有所保留。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"早就該交給我了！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"簡單，我會輕鬆解決的。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，看你的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_1_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......“如果爭端能夠避免，那我們應當沉默——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——如果戰鬥是必要的，那就戰鬥到最後！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島的信念......從來沒有改變過！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_1_3"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["近衛幹員"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["醫療幹員"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["杜賓"]}]}
